{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47212","headline":"三峡闻猨 · 慕幽","name":"三峡闻猨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁向兹来不恨生，声声都是断肠声。\n七千里外一家住，十二峰前独自行。\n瘴雨晚藏神女庙，蛮烟寒锁夜郎城。\n凭君且听哀吟好，会待青云道路平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慕幽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}